      "v": 4,
      "zh": "第七年，耶何耶大打发人叫迦利人（或译：亲兵）和护卫兵的众百夫长来，领他们进了耶和华的殿，与他们立约，使他们在耶和华殿里起誓，又将王的儿子指给他们看，",
      "en": "In the seventh year Jehoiada summoned[NOTE:1] the officers of the units of hundreds of the Carians[NOTE:2] and the royal bodyguard.[NOTE:3] He met with them[NOTE:4] in the Lord’s temple. He made an agreement[NOTE:5] with them and made them swear an oath of allegiance in the Lord’s temple. Then he showed them the king’s son.",
