    {
      "v": 19,
      "zh": "又率领百夫长和迦利人（或译：亲兵）与护卫兵，以及国中的众民，请王从耶和华殿下来，由护卫兵的门进入王宫，他就坐了王位。",
      "en": "He took the officers of the units of hundreds, the Carians, the royal bodyguard, and all the people of the land, and together they led the king down from the Lord’s temple. They entered the royal palace through the Gate of the Royal Bodyguard,[NOTE:1] and the king[NOTE:2] sat down on the royal throne.",
